### Create activity class (run Authenticate in auth.http first)
POST {{base_url}}/activity-classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sportId": "932dc1dc-fa6e-48c0-89f5-4d9e8a61a4ba",
  "roomId": "81ed8aab-deda-4a43-8687-c86d2e9cb236",
  "trainerId": "87a7f402-872a-4d88-9225-e774415f69b9",
  "weekdays": [
    "MONDAY"
  ],
  "startTime": "11:30",
  "endTime": "12:30",
  "capacity": 20,
  "monthlyFee": 180.00
}


