### Create activity class (swimming) in the right room
POST {{base_url}}/activity-classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "sportId": "971528da-c963-4299-8b5c-15f47348d10a",
  "roomId": "d43d88ee-1b0d-43c8-be40-6ab42b8561a6",
